    59	- **Set availability** stays pinned to the bottom of the screen in every state, with or without a notice (D-81 F12, D-43), **inside the action bar** (Round 4, 2026-11-02, item 1). The content above the bar scrolls on short phones (at 360×640 the timer and the wheel are never clipped); the bar never covers the last content; toasts sit above the bar.
    60	- **Time added:** 5:00 + 30 min shows 35:00 (D-81 F10).
    61	- **End availability** is greyed out while offline; the offline notice explains (D-81 F13).
