    63	
    64	- Home answers "Am I taking cases right now, and what do I do next?" Nothing is pushed: the doctor **requests** a case (pull model).
    65	- **Set availability:** quick picks 15 / 30 / 45 min, 1 / 2 / 3 hours, plus the wheel (hours and minutes, 15-minute steps). Minimum **15 minutes**, any start time, no maximum (24/7). Confirm starts the countdown.
    66	- **Time remaining:** h:mm:ss from one hour up (1:00:00), m:ss below (9:42). Shows 0:00 when it has ended (D-53, 2026-10-15). The label and the timer do not move when **+ Add time** appears; Add time sits on the value row (A-09). Labels are 14 px grey (A-10).
    67	- **Request a case** while time remains. A request made before the window ends is honoured even if the case arrives after.
    68	- **Add time:** shown when time is running low (near expiry, `[MOCK]` 5 min); same picker in a sheet; "Time added" toast. An error in the add-time sheet sits 16 above its button, as on the page (A-12).
    69	- **End availability:** confirmation sheet. If a request is pending: no new requests, the pending one is honoured, availability ends after it resolves and any assigned case closes ("Ending availability", no time row).
    70	- **Window ends during a case:** the case is never interrupted. The ending card then offers only **Back to Home**; Home shows the ended state.
    71	- **Prescriptions today:** a count only, no earnings. A case counts when its prescription is confirmed. It stays visible after availability ends.
    72	- **Result notices on Home** ("Availability ends soon", setup / add / request failures) sit inside the action bar, above its button (RULES §9.5, A-19). "No cases right now" and offline are the bar's own action, so they sit inside the bar above the button (lane-request 7). Screen-wide standing notices (idle-expired, manually ended, expired-pending, stop-pending) stay at the top of the panel.
    73	- **Checking…** status line in the bar is centred in the button's slot, as on the case page (A-11).
    74	- **No cases:** neutral notice "No cases right now. Try again in a minute." Auto re-check `[OPEN OQ-019]`.
    75	- Notifications bell, Help and Profile icons on Home; the bell never inside a case. Help's content is not designed yet (backlog).
    76	- **Profile page** (D-70: a page, not a sheet — task header with Back, no logo; content ported from the current app with design-system fixes, D-69; full redesign later): doctor name and role · today's earnings (earned, incentive) · User manual · **Faster sign-in on/off** · **Log out** (destructive). During an open case Log out is replaced by "You can log out after this case is closed." Log out is the last item in the content (not pinned). Cards are 16 apart and Log out is 16 below the last card (A-13). The group label "Today's earnings" is 16 semibold, like the other group labels (A-20). Log out asks first in a **sheet**: "Log out? — You'll stop getting cases until you sign in again." · Log out · Stay signed in.
