| A-R02 | Setting/Adding disable wheel, chips, Cancel and Close; no concurrent request. Failure retains original duration and deadline. Unknown request keeps Checking until reconciled; no duplicate retry. | automation gap: busy-fixture interaction plus operation-log identity | app-logic.md:57; feedback-state-map.md:113-129 |
| A-R03 | Timer formats 1:00:00 at one hour, 59:59 below, 0:00 at expiry. Add 30 minutes to 5:00 yields 35:00; request just before expiry honoured; end while request pending honours exactly that request and no new ones. | automation gap: exact deadline oracle; H05/H08 cover only broad behavior | app-logic.md:59,65-68 |
| A-R04 | Successful prescription alone increases today's count; callback/unavailable/submitted without record do not. Confirm increments once; availability ending retains count; earnings follow confirmed count × registry-approved per-prescription setting. | automation gap: assert actual before/after counts, not merely label/log presence | app-logic.md:70,143,190-191,278 |
| A-R05 | Profile screen lock toggle off needs no prompt; success on enables; cancelled has no error; failed stays off with registry error; no screen lock hides toggle. Bell, Help and manual open placeholders and return correctly; no automatic support report. | automation gap for success/unsupported/placeholders; options.mjs covers failed/cancelled | app-logic.md:74-76; plan v3.2: section 0 Help/bell |
