| A-R20 | Every confirm variant blocks Pending, scrolls first pending, correct singular/plural count, no request sent; Callback/Unavailable/Skip HA remain allowed where eligible. Confirm busy/unknown freezes editing, rejects duplicate submits and reconciles success/failure before retry. | journeys.mjs; automation gap for count, scroll and request idempotence | app-logic.md:146,173,190,194 |

No open product rule is settled here. Hold gaps/attempts, record wait, polling, near-expiry and duration defaults retain the approved settings/mock labels. Production dependencies (OQ-024/025/030) remain backend work. The tests do not demand real telephony, Ops, production sessions or genuine patient data.

