    28	## 1. What we're building
    29	
    30	A clean, modular rebuild of the doctor app prototype from the approved screens, on a new Netlify site (D-56, D-72).
    31	
    32	| | Review mode (bare link) | Demo mode (`?demo=1`, installed app) |
    33	|---|---|---|
    34	| Who it's for | Apurva, design team, Engineering | Anyone trying touch and feel on a phone |
    35	| Case types | Cat4 · Pilot HA free · Pilot no HA free · Pilot HA skipped (customer / system) | Cat4 only |
    36	| States | Every launch state in app-logic and every approved picture (A-only left out) | Happy path: sign-in → OTP → Home → case → prescribe → call → Prescription confirmed → next case |
    37	| Controls | Desktop: review panel beside the phone frame. Phone: app full screen, play link (QR) + hidden drawer **[R2]** | None |
    38	| Call gate | Real 50 s (a setting), with fast-forward | Whole clock runs faster (see B10), so the call still counts as valid **[R]** |
    39	| Installable | — | Yes: Add to Home Screen, opens full screen |
    40	
    41	The old `index.html` / `app.js` / `styles.css` stay frozen; the current site keeps serving them until Apurva approves the new one.
